            "id": 132667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali campi sono inclusi nel corpo JSON della richiesta?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"POST https://fakenews.com/article\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;UFOs sighted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;content&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Belive it or not ...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>title</code> e <code>content</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code> e <code>date</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>content</code> e <code>author</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>date</code> e <code>author</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>title</code> e <code>content</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #21",
            "id": 132685,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando crei un endpoint <code>PATCH</code>, in genere hai bisogno di un parametro di route?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, per specificare la risorsa che viene aggiornata</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, la risorsa viene aggiornata in base al solo corpo della richiesta</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, le richieste <code>PATCH</code> non usano parametri di percorso</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, per specificare la risorsa che viene aggiornata.</p></body></html>"
          },
